popular and so meaningful to so many people.

00:22:41.490 --> 00:22:47.410
It’s called “The Thrones Effect: How Game
of Thrones Conquered Pop Culture” . It’s

00:22:47.410 --> 00:22:53.060
written and read by all these Thrones channels
including History of Westeros, Got Academy,

00:22:53.060 --> 00:22:58.150
GrayArea, and more, and you can get it on
